---
// Shown on draft entries. Drafts only render in `astro dev` (see getVisibleEntries),
// so this badge never reaches the production site.
---

<span class="draft-badge">DRAFT</span>

<style>
  .draft-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.125rem 0.5rem;
    border: 1px dashed currentColor;
    border-radius: 0.25rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    /* amber-100 / amber-900: about 9:1 contrast */
    background: #fef3c7;
    color: #78350f;
  }

  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    .draft-badge {
      /* amber-950 / amber-200: about 10:1 contrast */
      background: #451a03;
      color: #fde68a;
    }
  }
</style>
